cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
type: software
title: "A Confound-Aware ADHD-200 MRI/fMRI Benchmark: Structural, Functional, and Fusion Evaluation"
abstract: >-
  Research benchmark testing whether structural MRI and resting-state fMRI add
  predictive information about ADHD beyond age, sex and motion/QC confounds in
  ADHD-200, using subject-level mixed-site cross-validation, nested
  leave-one-site-out evaluation and a prespecified confirmatory fusion
  analysis. The tested imaging models did not establish stable
  confound-independent generalization across sites. Research use only; not a
  diagnostic system.
authors:
